---
// src/components/ecommerce/AboutTeamGrid.astro
import { Users, Sparkles, Search, BookOpen, Palette, HeartHandshake, Award } from 'lucide-vue-next';
---

<section class="py-28 bg-white font-bilbola relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Fondo decorativo editorial -->
  <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-[40rem] h-[40rem] rounded-full bg-bilbola-mint-light/15 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-1/3 w-[30rem] h-[30rem] rounded-full bg-bilbola-surface-warmSoft/25 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Encabezado -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bilbola-pill bg-bilbola-mint-light/60 text-bilbola-action-focus font-black text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-2xs transform hover:scale-105 transition-all">
        <Users class="w-4 h-4 text-bilbola-action-focus shrink-0" />
        <span>Artesanos de la Magia</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary tracking-tight mb-6 font-bilbola">
        Conoce a Nuestro Equipo de Diseño
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-bilbola-text-secondary font-medium leading-relaxed">
        Nos apasiona crear espacios mágicos y únicos que conecten con el niño interior, generando experiencias sensoriales inolvidables llenas de amor y armonía para toda la familia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Fila Superior: Fundadora / Visionaria (Estilo Revista / Magazine Editorial) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-bilbola-surface-neutralSoft via-white to-bilbola-mint-light/30 p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-bilbola-lg border-2 border-bilbola-mint-light shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-bilbola-mint-light/20 rounded-bl-full pointer-events-none group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-10 lg:gap-14 relative z-10 text-center lg:text-left">
          <div class="w-28 h-28 sm:w-36 sm:h-36 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-bilbola-mint-light flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-action-focus shadow-xl transform group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-500">
            <Sparkles class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 stroke-[1.5]" />
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex-grow space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3">
              <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola tracking-tight">Macarena</h3>
              <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-bilbola-action-focus text-white text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">
                La Visionaria
              </span>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text-base font-extrabold text-bilbola-action-focus/90 uppercase tracking-wide">Fundadora &amp; Líder Creativa de Bílbola</p>
            
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-bilbola-text-secondary font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Su pasión por el diseño y su visión inspiradora son la roca fundacional de todo lo que hacemos en Bílbola. Siempre en la búsqueda activa de nuevas tendencias sostenibles, armonías de color y estilos auténticos que agreguen un toque único y verdaderamente especial a cada uno de nuestros productos y espacios infantiles.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-3 flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-bilbola-text-primary">
              <Award class="w-4 h-4 text-bilbola-action-focus shrink-0" />
              <span>Dirección de arte, inspiración e innovación en cada colección</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Grilla 2x2 para Talentos Co-creadores con Personalidades de Color -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <!-- JP: Acento Azul -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-2 h-full bg-[#B1C9E8] group-hover:w-3 transition-all"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-6">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-[#B1C9E8]/40 border border-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <Search class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola">Juan Pablo</h4>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#B1C9E8]/40 text-bilbola-text-primary font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                  El Investigador de Calidad
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Experto en selección de materias primas y control de excelencia intransigeente. Investiga y evalúa exhaustivamente cada artículo para asegurar que cumpla con nuestros estándares más exigentes de exclusividad, durabilidad y seguridad no tóxica.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">
            <span>Control de calidad y materiales nobles</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#B1C9E8] animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Renata: Acento Rosa WarmSoft -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-2 h-full bg-[#F6DFE0] group-hover:w-3 transition-all"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-6">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-[#F6DFE0] border border-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <BookOpen class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola">Renata</h4>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#F6DFE0] text-bilbola-text-primary font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                  La Cuentacuentos
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Encargada de eventos y talleres sensoriales. Su creatividad y amor profundo por los cuentos de fantasía hacen que cada experiencia en nuestra tienda sea mágica, llena de historias inspiradoras que estimulan la creatividad de niños y adultos.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">
            <span>Fantasía, narrativas y talleres infantiles</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F6DFE0] animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mauricio: Acento Menta -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-2 h-full bg-bilbola-mint-depth group-hover:w-3 transition-all"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-6">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-bilbola-mint-light border border-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-action-focus group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <Palette class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola">Mauricio</h4>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-bilbola-mint-light text-bilbola-action-focus font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                  El Maestro de la Estética
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Nuestro talentoso diseñador de mobiliario e interiores. Su ojo minucioso para el detalle y su habilidad para crear ambientes sutilmente encantadores hacen que cada rincón refleje calidez, elegancia y la más pura esencia de la infancia.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-bilbola-action-focus font-bold">
            <span>Armonía visual, paletas y diseño de ambientes</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-bilbola-action-focus animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Anita: Acento Amarillo Pastel -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-2 h-full bg-[#FAF1BA] group-hover:w-3 transition-all"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-6">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-[#FAF1BA] border border-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <HeartHandshake class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola">Anita</h4>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF1BA] text-bilbola-text-primary font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                  La Encantadora de Clientes
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary font-normal leading-relaxed">
              Amable encargada de atención al cliente y asesoría en decoración. Se asegura de que cada consulta sea atendida con dulzura, guiando a las familias con la máxima dedicación para encontrar la armonía perfecta para cada dormitorio.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">
            <span>Asesoría personalizada y calidez humana</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF1BA] animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
